    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the wing tank access panels, the closure hardware and the fittings that pass through the panels, covering the wet sealed and the retained face seal closures.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the wing tank access panels, the fastener and sleeve hardware for both closure standards, and the transmitter, switch and clamp items that pass through or attach to the panels.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn for the left wing lower surface; the right wing is a mirror image with the same part numbers. The protective sleeve at item 40 is used only on the retained face seal closure and must not be fitted to a wet sealed panel, where it holds the panel off the sealant bead. Item quantities are for one panel."
    },
